%% YorkLanes — SSR page load with session
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Nginx as nginx :443
  participant Web as apps/web Astro
  participant API as apps/api Express
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres

  User->>Nginx: GET /schedule (Cookie yorklanes.sid)
  Nginx->>Web: proxy to :4321
  Web->>Web: fetchSessionUser(cookie)
  Web->>API: GET /api/auth/me (Cookie header)
  API->>DB: SELECT users by session
  DB-->>API: user row
  API-->>Web: JSON user
  par SSR data fetches
    Web->>API: GET /api/course-sections/terms
    API->>DB: SELECT DISTINCT term
    DB-->>API: terms[]
    Web->>API: GET /api/schedules
    API->>DB: list saved schedules
    DB-->>API: schedules[]
  end
  API-->>Web: JSON responses
  Web->>Web: serializeForScript → HTML + #schedule-ssr JSON
  Web-->>Nginx: HTML
  Nginx-->>User: page + embedded SSR payload
  User->>Web: client init schedule-page.ts
  Web->>Web: hydrate from SSR, background refresh
